        "note": "EmissionProcess: MOVES's own statement of which processes happen on a real road. `occursOnRealRoads` is what decides whether a selected pollutant-process produces output rows at all -- start exhaust and extended idle write their rates on the off-network road type 1, and a RunSpec that does not select road type 1 discards those blocks entire (docs/mixed-onroad.md 0.2). The national table has 25 rows; the execution-database copy has the 2 this run touches.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
